<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kanta and balama</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The kanta and balama were professional military commanders appointed by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/askia-muhammad">Askia Muhammad</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/songhai-empire">Songhai Empire</a>. Each was responsible for a specific territorial zone. Their appointment was part of the reorganisation of the Songhai army on a more regular basis.</p></div>
